{title: Tomay Ghire}
{artist: Tahsan Khan}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Tomay ghire je [G]bhalo laga,        [C]Hoyni bola [G]bhasay
[Em]Hajar bhirer majhe [G]khuje pawa,        [C]Sei tumi aaj [G]kothay
[Em]Tomake niye sei [C]sritira,        Sudhu [Am]khuje phere [D]amader
Ki [G]jeno ki vebe [Bm]acho sudure,        [C]Esho na [Am]fire... [G]hridoye
[Am]Somoy jure sudhu [Em]shunnota,        [Am]Nirobe chuye [B]thake
[C]Vuleo ami [Bm]bhabini,        [Am]Harabo kokhono [D]tomay [C]avabe
[Em]Tomake niye [C]shopno gulo,        Aajo [Am]khuje phere [D]amader
Ki [G]jeno ki vule [Bm]hariye gele,        [C]Esho na [Am]fire... [G]hridoye
[Am]Moner akashe [Em]megher vela,        [Am]Bedonar bristi [B]jhore
[C]Ato kache chile [Bm]tobuo,        [Am]Parini keno [D]tomay [C]bojhate
[Em]Tomake niye [C]shopno gulo,        Aajo [Am]khuje phere [D]amader
Ki [G]jeno ki vebe [Bm]hariye gele,        [C]Esho na [Am]fire... [G]hridoye
[Em]Tomake niye [C]shopno gulo,        Aajo [Am]khuje phere [D]amader
Ki [G]jeno ki vule [Bm]hariye gele,        [C]Esho na [Am]fire... [G]hridoye
